{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143230_b460e6a8","chunk_index":1,"job_id":"mwjob_ca1eb8feb6baceb8d4fb9eb7","precondition_digest":"db10dd72ce67bd844e06b3dcc432ecba426e9ae405fcfe31cd698c3866db6cf2","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v1","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_db84fad0e1f348fc","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0687d5113cc82a0a","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5f2555c78168de91","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_ec775a481341d056","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2b3b651762037aa3","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0d1c72ba25343e73","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cf9127212cfac33d","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_650a3ed48fbc8ff8"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143230_b460e6a8","evidence_span_ids":["span_protocol_summary_title","span_project_id","span_project_title","span_project_phase","span_project_design","span_project_intervention","span_project_primary_endpoint","span_project_key_secondary","span_project_sample","span_project_visits","span_project_no_interim","span_project_no_sample_reest"],"heading":"方案概要","proposal_text":"本研究为一项在中国开展的III期、多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组确证性临床研究，方案编号为MW-III-AEA61047-DRAFT。研究药物为合成试验药A，拟用于治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病。计划入组132例受试者，按1:1随机分配至合成试验药A 100 mg口服每日一次组或匹配安慰剂组，双盲治疗16周，随后进行4周安全性随访。筛选期最长4周；基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访；PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答的受试者比例；关键次要终点包括第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的比例以及PASI 90应答比例。研究不计划期中分析，样本量不再估计。","rationale":"依据当前项目已确认研究事实中方案编号、研究题目、分期、设计、干预、样本量、终点、访视和期中分析信息撰写，并绑定章节包方案概要身份。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_db84fad0e1f348fc","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:432fbbf3ffe8108e7995c3c0","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143230_b460e6a8","evidence_span_ids":["span_protocol_background_title","span_protocol_existing_background","span_project_title","span_project_population","span_project_primary_obj","span_project_secondary_obj","span_project_phase","span_project_design","span_project_intervention","span_project_sample"],"heading":"研究背景和立项依据","proposal_text":"斑块状银屑病是一种需要系统治疗的慢性炎症性皮肤病，成人中重度患者常需长期干预。合成试验药A为小分子口服固体制剂，系统暴露，拟每日一次口服给药。当前项目已确认将开展一项针对成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者的III期确证性研究，开发区域为中国，采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组设计，对照措施为匹配安慰剂。该研究旨在评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂的疗效，并评价其对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响。研究计划入组132例受试者，按1:1随机分配，试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服每日一次，对照组接受匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗16周。","rationale":"依据当前项目研究定义中适应症、药物技术类型、给药途径、研究分期、确证性目的、设计、对照、人群和样本量信息撰写；章节包已有背景碎片仅用于身份绑定。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0687d5113cc82a0a","section_number":"2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:432fbbf3ffe8108e7995c3c0","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143230_b460e6a8","evidence_span_ids":["span_protocol_disease_title","span_project_population","span_project_inclusion","span_project_exclusion","span_project_primary_endpoint"],"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","proposal_text":"本研究目标人群为确诊为斑块状银屑病、疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者。入选标准要求年龄≥18岁，确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月，筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3，并且适合接受系统治疗或光疗。上述标准界定了需要系统治疗或光疗的中重度斑块状银屑病成人患者。研究将关注该人群的皮损清除程度和皮肤病相关生活质量，并以第16周PASI 75应答作为主要疗效评价指标。排除标准包括非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","rationale":"依据当前项目研究定义中目标人群、入选标准和排除标准撰写，并以章节包疾病背景章节身份绑定。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5f2555c78168de91","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:432fbbf3ffe8108e7995c3c0","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143230_b460e6a8","evidence_span_ids":["span_protocol_mechanism_title","span_protocol_existing_intervention","span_project_tech","span_project_route","span_project_dosage_form","span_project_exposure","span_project_intervention"],"heading":"作用机制及同类药物研究进展","proposal_text":"合成试验药A为小分子药物，采用口服途径给药，剂型为口服固体制剂，系统暴露。当前项目已确认的试验干预为：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。这一给药方案为在成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者中评价每日一次口服治疗的疗效和安全性提供了基础。本研究为III期确证性研究，采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组设计，旨在验证合成试验药A相较安慰剂的疗效，并观察其对皮损清除和生活质量的影响。本方案不引用其他项目或竞品的数据，仅围绕合成试验药A的已确认给药方案和III期确证性研究设计进行表述。","rationale":"依据当前项目研究定义中药物技术类型、给药途径、剂型、系统暴露、试验干预和总体设计撰写；章节包已有干预碎片用于身份绑定。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_ec775a481341d056","section_number":"2.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:432fbbf3ffe8108e7995c3c0","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143230_b460e6a8","evidence_span_ids":["span_protocol_drug_title","span_project_tech","span_project_route","span_project_dosage_form","span_project_exposure","span_project_dose","span_project_placebo","span_project_random"],"heading":"研究药物简介","proposal_text":"合成试验药A为小分子药物，给药途径为口服，剂型为口服固体制剂，局部/系统暴露范围为系统暴露。试验组给药方案为合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，自第1天至第16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂，每日一次口服，第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。两组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价。研究药物为系统暴露的口服小分子制剂，支持在成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者中开展每日一次口服治疗。","rationale":"依据当前项目研究定义中药物技术类型、给药途径、剂型、系统暴露、剂量与给药方案、匹配安慰剂和随机分配信息撰写。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2b3b651762037aa3","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:432fbbf3ffe8108e7995c3c0","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143230_b460e6a8","evidence_span_ids":["span_protocol_nonclinical_title","span_project_tech","span_project_route","span_project_dosage_form","span_project_exposure","span_project_dose"],"heading":"非临床研究结果","proposal_text":"合成试验药A为小分子口服药物，剂型为口服固体制剂，系统暴露，拟每日一次口服给药。支持本III期研究的非临床研究资料围绕该药物的药效学、药代动力学和毒理学特征进行评价，以支持其在成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者中连续16周每日一次给药的临床开发。本方案已确认的试验干预为100 mg口服每日一次、连续16周，因此非临床评价需与系统暴露和口服给药途径相适应。本章节不重复其他项目或竞品数据，相关内容以合成试验药A的研究者手册为准。","rationale":"依据当前项目研究定义中药物技术类型、给药途径、剂型、系统暴露和给药方案撰写框架性候选；具体非临床结果未在允许来源中给出，已列入不确定性。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0d1c72ba25343e73","section_number":"2.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:432fbbf3ffe8108e7995c3c0","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143230_b460e6a8","evidence_span_ids":["span_protocol_clinical_title","span_project_intervention","span_project_dose","span_project_primary_endpoint","span_project_key_secondary","span_project_other_secondary"],"heading":"既往临床研究结果","proposal_text":"当前项目已确认的给药方案为合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周，对照为匹配安慰剂。该III期确证性研究将在成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者中评价第16周PASI 75应答、sPGA 0或1且较基线改善≥2级、PASI 90应答以及PASI和DLQI较基线变化。既往临床研究结果用于支持上述剂量选择和疗效评价指标，重点关注每日一次口服给药在目标人群中的疗效与安全性。本章节不重复其他项目或竞品数据，相关内容以合成试验药A的研究者手册为准。","rationale":"依据当前项目研究定义中给药方案、干预、主要终点、关键次要终点和其他次要终点撰写候选；具体既往临床数据未在允许来源中给出，已列入不确定性。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cf9127212cfac33d","section_number":"2.3.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:432fbbf3ffe8108e7995c3c0","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260921143230_b460e6a8","evidence_span_ids":["span_protocol_rationale_title","span_protocol_existing_rationale","span_project_purpose","span_project_design","span_project_multicenter","span_project_primary_endpoint","span_project_key_secondary","span_project_sample","span_project_stats","span_project_no_interim"],"heading":"本研究的理论基础","proposal_text":"本研究为确证性III期临床研究，采用平行组、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机设计，在中国多中心开展。研究假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，计划入组132例，每组66例。主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答的受试者比例；关键次要终点包括第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的比例和PASI 90应答比例。主要分析将按随机分组采用CMH方法比较，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。不计划期中分析。","rationale":"依据当前项目研究定义中确证性目的、总体设计、多中心模式、主要终点、关键次要终点、样本量假设和统计分析策略撰写，并绑定章节包理论基础身份。","section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_650a3ed48fbc8ff8","section_number":"2.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:432fbbf3ffe8108e7995c3c0","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:432fbbf3ffe8108e7995c3c0","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:432fbbf3ffe8108e7995c3c0","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"1db3c5a3c36329d2415da857031c0359049171875377269215d7a50c4c79ab7b"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:26|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"33118fc6958419e645c6a0a19471c78f80e0c4c28be03b46f2b3e61d287e0305"},{"locator":"section:3.6.3.3 研究药物的计数|block:620|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"5d7954edffb46be99638e2135e77631b0c5d64bf28fd8aeb9376a387c2a93b8f"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:25|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"68663fd612a1770f44cc3c20e025cf77d568a22b8c10c9a906d5ceb40702d87e"},{"locator":"section:6.1.2 不良事件的记录|block:929|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"b2d1246434edb81ee0bb75a9cf409fdbc23560d34b91ee573a5736db7ee6d225"},{"locator":"section:独立数据监查委员会|block:792|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"26824e050825b072ae0a7dd2eee48a5657c0d43ba2c463b531efc0feabf1a014"}]}